│C█▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀█ │
└─█ New Pull Request · parity-bot/pr-details                                                     █─┘
┌─█                                                                                              █─┐
│ █ Base        main                         ← Compare  Choose a head ref              Draft [ ] █ │
│ █ Title       Compose the PR dialogs                                                           █━│
│ █                                                                                              █ │
│ █ Description  Write   Preview  ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── █ │
│ █   1  ## What changed                                                                         █ │
│ █   2                                                                                          █ │
│ █   3  Create PR and Edit PR open as the compose sheet: one-row fields with their labels       █ │
│ █      on the left, the branch row with Base, Compare and Draft on one line, the               █ │
│ █      description under Write and Preview tabs, and Reviewers as one row until it has         █ │
│ █      focus.                                                                                  █─│
│ █   4                                                                                          █ │
└─█   5  ## Why                                                                                  █ │
┌─█   6                                                                                      ▁▁  █ │
│ █   7  The old dialog was a 36-row frame over 59 rows of content: the Create button was        █ │
│ █      below the fold, and at 100x30 only one row of the description showed.                   █ │
│ █   8                                                                                          █ │
│ █   9  ## Testing                                                                              █ │
│ █  10                                                                                          █ │
│ █  11  - unit tests for focus, the tab order, the Reviewers summary and its expansion          █ │
│ █  12  - snapshots at 160x48 and 100x30                                                        █ │
│ █  13  - the parity scenarios, whose writes are unchanged                                      █ │
│ █                                                                                              █ │
│ █ Reviewers  parity-friend  (tab to edit)      ▌                                                 │
│ █▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▌ Restored saved PR draft                         │
